    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hairy man Gu Immortals advance it to rank seven inside a refinement formation. The fire takes dog shit immortal materials including faeces of star desolate hounds, faeces of remnant heavenly dogs, and excrement of the jade statue white hound. Those materials are covered on faeces of star desolate hounds, faeces of remnant heavenly dogs, and excrement of the jade statue white hound. It remains Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s former vital Gu, with a strong supplementary effect once it is no longer stuck at rank six.",
        "chapters": [
          1913
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-seven-advance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "race_hairy_men",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "res_faeces_of_star_desolate_hound",
          "res_faeces_of_remnant_heavenly_dog",
          "res_excrement_of_jade_statue_white_hound",
          "sys_vital_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later refinement advances it to rank eight. It is the core Immortal Gu of Cooking Luck Pot.",
        "chapters": [
          2079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-eight-cooking-luck-pot",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_cooking_luck_pot"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "This Immortal Gu looks like a dung beetle. Its whole body is golden yellow. It has three parts: head, stomach, and tail. Its head is like a crescent shovel with paddle-like tentacles on its sides. Its stomach has a horizontal ridge, and its tail is oval. It has two pairs of legs and a pair of tails. Every tentacle is rough and thick, and has hard black barbs on their ends.",
        "chapters": [
          2079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Before leaving Lang Ya blessed land, Fang Yuan has already used luck path killer moves to increase his luck. Since the tribulation, he has been using dog shit luck Immortal Gu continuously.",
        "chapters": [
          1056
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-after-tribulation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It has no offense or defense of its own. Its value is passive luck help. Against heaven’s will, luck path can be used; Fang Yuan guesses that one escape from a heaven’s-will beast tide was likely thanks to Dog Shit Luck. He places it among the key parts of Giant Sun’s self luck true inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          1093
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "luck-help-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_self_luck_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As a luck path Gu worm it is fed with the faeces of six types of desolate hounds. Lang Ya land spirit’s previous self purchased that food through treasure yellow heaven; the current spirit advises Fang Yuan to rear desolate hounds in his immortal aperture instead.",
        "chapters": [
          1093
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "luck-help-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Remnant heavenly dog faeces are not the right food at rank six; that food becomes useful only if the Gu is raised to rank seven. That material is covered on faeces of remnant heavenly dogs.",
        "chapters": [
          1133
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-six-food-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_faeces_of_remnant_heavenly_dog"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
