  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit contrasts it with Fortune Rivalling Heaven, which Giant Sun Immortal Venerable refined only in his later years.",
        "chapters": [
          1029
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "gu_fortune_rivalling_heaven_immortal_gu",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan has never heard of this Immortal Gu before that exchange.",
        "chapters": [
          1030
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ying Wu Xie treats the Gu as a likely recent Lang Ya loan to Fang Yuan.",
        "chapters": [
          1060
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ying-wu-xies-guess",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ying_wu_xie",
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Weighing how to use luck against heaven’s will, Ying Wu Xie judges that Fang Yuan has the better luck, since Fang Yuan owns dog shit luck Immortal Gu, and Sixth Hair, who is in Lang Ya Sect, is not to be forgotten either. Because of that, Ying Wu Xie had already used Connect Luck to link his own luck to Hei Lou Lan’s; she was unwilling and could not resist. This way, Ying Wu Xie and Fang Yuan truly have their luck connected.",
        "chapters": [
          1153
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ying-wu-xies-assessment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "gu_connect_luck",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Giant Sun developed in his early days, much of that success is attributed to this Gu. With its protection, Fang Yuan’s luck turns from a weakness into a strength once Spring Autumn Cicada is sealed. The gain is reduced when the Gu’s effect is split across people linked by Connect Luck.",
        "chapters": [
          1239
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-days-and-connect-luck",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
